 90   40EE              ; pulse: E = the input as last read -> waits for bit 7 of R14 to change.
 91   40EE              ;        C = the turns it waited, 44 T-states each; 0 if the edge came
 92   40EE              ;        before it looked, or if it waited more than 255 turns: a
 93   40EE              ;        silence ended. E = the input now. Uses A
